{"id":"n72088-1-7","stage":2,"title":"이따 · 稍后","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72088-1-7-1","ko":"수업 끝나고 이따 저녁에 다시 보자!","zh":"下课后再在晚上见吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"수업","meaning":"授课，讲课","explanation":"수업：授课，讲课","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝나고","meaning":"下课，下班","explanation":"끝나다：下课，下班；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이따","meaning":"稍后，回头","explanation":"이따：稍后，回头","readings":[{"term":"이따","audio":"/audio/47b7085f8116ec397859.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72088","senseId":"1","lemma":"이따","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다시","meaning":"再次，再一次","explanation":"다시：再次，再一次","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"4","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보자!","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"01c1761e85dc638b","term":"수업","zh":"授课，讲课","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3","entryId":"64597","definition":"教师教学生知识或技术。","pronunciation":["수업"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"下课，下班","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"在学校或公司等地方做完当天的功课或业务。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"47b7085f8116ec39","term":"이따","zh":"稍后，回头","audio":"/audio/47b7085f8116ec397859.mp3","entryId":"72088","definition":"过一会儿时间以后。","pronunciation":["이따"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"再次，再一次","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"下一次再。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f66c2185e89147de92c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72088-1-7-2","ko":"응, 그래. 저녁 시간에 식당에서 봐!","zh":"嗯，好啊。晚上在餐厅见吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，唉","explanation":"응：是，唉","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"1","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저녁","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간에","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식당에서","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐!","meaning":"见，碰头","explanation":"보다：见，碰头；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，唉","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于回应对方的呼叫。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"见，碰头","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"以某种目的而见人。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/169b91dacc927e81fa63.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.11,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72088","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":68,"sequenceScore":1.8353,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，好啊。晚上在餐厅见吧！","今天太冷了。","下课后再在晚上见吧！"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，好啊。晚上在餐厅见吧！","下课后再在晚上见吧！","今天太冷了。"],"answer":0}]}
